'''Auto-pickup''' is a feature unlocked at [[SkyBlock Levels|{{Aqua|SkyBlock Level 6}}]]. It causes all item and mob drops to directly be added to the inventory, and the [[Stash]] if there is no space in the inventory.

== Overview ==
'''Auto-pickup''' causes all item, mob, and block drops to be added directly to the [[Inventory|inventory]] without being dropped as physical items on the ground. The player can still drop items from their hotbar and inventory.

Some items are '''not''' affected by '''Auto-pickup''', such as drops from [[Slayer Miniboss|Slayer Minibosses]]. This is most likely a bug.

