== Trivia ==
* Originally, the {{Ench|Telekinesis}} [[Enchantment]] could be applied to items at {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} and served the same function as '''Auto-pickup'''.
** After {{Ench|Telekinesis}} was removed, all {{Item|Enchanted Book|enchant=Telekinesis}} became glitched {{Common}} {{Item|Enchanted Book}}s with no enchantment.

